<h1>Sports League Management Software</h1>

<p class="lead">Sports league management software that keeps teams, schedules, fees, and announcements together — so coaches and league coordinators don’t spend game day reconciling spreadsheets.</p>

<img src="/images/ss-calendar.png" alt="Sports league schedule with teams, RSVPs, and volunteer assignments" width="827" height="827" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" class="rounded border">

<section id="why-sports" class="card" aria-labelledby="why-sports-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="why-sports-heading">For volunteer-run leagues</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Rec leagues and school programs have the same core needs as any people-powered group: a clear roster, a findable calendar, a way to collect fees and track expenses, and messages that actually reach the right team. GatherPack puts those in one platform your board, coaches, and team managers all share — with permissions so a coach manages their roster and schedule without seeing league-wide finances.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">Open source (MIT) and self-hostable: run it yourself for free or let <a href="https://sledgehammerinfosystems.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sledgehammer Infosystems</a> host it. <a href="/open-source/">Self-host vs managed</a> · <a href="/hosting/">Pricing tiers</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="tailored" class="card" aria-labelledby="tailored-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="tailored-heading">Tailored for leagues &amp; clubs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <div class="row g-4">

      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex">
        <div class="feature-card w-100">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <i class="fa-4x fa-solid fa-people-group" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card__body">
            <h3>Divisions &amp; teams</h3>
            <p>Group by division, team, and sub-team. Team managers handle their own members, events, and check-ins; league admins keep the full view. <a href="/features/members/">Members →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex">
        <div class="feature-card w-100">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <i class="fa-4x fa-solid fa-calendar-days" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card__body">
            <h3>Games, practices &amp; shifts</h3>
            <p>Schedule games and practices; let families RSVP, sign up for snack duty and field prep, and check in at the venue. Custom fields for jersey sizes, carpools, etc. <a href="/features/events/">Events →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex">
        <div class="feature-card w-100">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <i class="fa-4x fa-solid fa-money-check-dollar" aria-hidden="true"></i>
