            <p>Track registration fees and expenses in a tagged ledger with receipt uploads. Stripe for online payments today; more rails on the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a>. <a href="/features/finance/">Finance →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex">
