            <p>One post for the right team — weather delays, field changes, or “bring water” — scheduled to appear and expire, with weekly digests so families don’t miss it. <a href="/features/communication/">Communication →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="integration" class="card" aria-labelledby="integration-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="integration-heading">Plays well with the rest</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Attendance feeds <a href="/features/automation/">volunteer hours &amp; reports</a> — useful for service credits or league-required volunteering. And because everything is team-scoped, a coach’s announcement or RSVP list only reflects their players and families.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">Similar needs: <a href="/use-cases/youth-clubs/">youth clubs</a> (families + dues), <a href="/use-cases/nonprofits/">nonprofits</a> (volunteer shifts), <a href="/use-cases/churches/">churches</a> (small-group teams), <a href="/use-cases/first-robotics/">FIRST Robotics</a> (season + kiosk).</p>
  </div>
</section>

