<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Sports league FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Can coaches manage only their team?</h3>
    <p>Yes — assign them as managers of that team. They’ll see their players, events, and check-ins without access to other teams’ rosters or league finances. <a href="/features/members/">Member roles</a></p>
    <h3 class="h5">Can we collect fees online?</h3>
    <p>Yes — Stripe handles cards and bank transfer today. Need PayPal/Venmo/Zeffy? That’s tracked on the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a> with explicit next steps. <a href="/features/finance/">Finance →</a></p>
    <h3 class="h5">What about rain-outs and last-minute changes?</h3>
    <p>Post a team-scoped announcement and push it immediately, or schedule it to expire when the decision window passes. Weekly digests catch the families who missed the alert. <a href="/features/communication/">Communication →</a></p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="/faq/">All FAQs →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

